.nasa.gov%2F&amp;embeds_referring_origin=https%3A%2F%2Fscience.nasa.gov&amp;source_ve_path=Mjg2NjY&amp;feature=emb_logo#bottom-sheet\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?time_continue=3&amp;v=2MJY_ptQW1o&amp;embeds_referring_euri=https%3A%2F%2Fscience.nasa.gov%2F&amp;embeds_referring_origin=https%3A%2F%2Fscience.nasa.gov&amp;source_ve_path=Mjg2NjY&amp;feature=emb_logo#bottom-sheet\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/OaZu3/bl4F4O3MywK/x9SPkCQI8kUReZVVqo7T8K/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">2024 Total Solar Eclipse: Through the Eyes of NASA (Official Broadcast)</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Watch live with us as a total solar eclipse moves across North America on April 8, 2024, traveling through Mexico, across the United States from Texas to Maine, and out across Canada’s Atlantic coast.A total solar eclipse occurs when the Moon passes be</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.youtube.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">우리가 자는 사이에 있었던 개기일식 나사 라이브입니다.<br>미국 캐나다 동부 일부 지역에서 개기일식이<br>그 주위에선 부분일식이 관측되었습니다.<br><br>그동네 사는 지인들에게 사진을 받았어요.<br>부럽네요....ㅎㅎㅎ<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ee319652598174b911a95b2d85f7a335a90138f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ee319652598174b911a95b2d85f7a335a90138f\" data-origin-width=\"739\" data-origin-height=\"1600\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a08858e562afcd81b74847f530a63da9504fd8b7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.dau